# 📦 Repository Management

| Command                      | Description                 | Usage                               |
| ---------------------------- | --------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |
| `helm repo add <name> <url>` | Add a Helm chart repository | First step before installing charts |
| `helm repo list`             | List added repositories     | Verify repo configuration           |
| `helm repo update`           | Update repo index           | Always run before install/upgrade   |
| `helm search repo <keyword>` | Search charts in repos      | Find available applications         |

---

# 🚀 Installation & Deployment

| Command                                             | Description                    | Usage                 |
| --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | --------------------- |
| `helm install <release> <chart>`                    | Install a chart                | Deploy application    |
| `helm install <release> <chart> -f values.yaml`     | Install with custom values     | 🔥 Real-world usage   |
| `helm install <release> <chart> --set key=value`    | Override values inline         | Quick testing         |
| `helm install <release> <chart> --namespace <ns>`   | Install in specific namespace  | Environment isolation |
| `helm install <release> <chart> --create-namespace` | Create namespace if not exists | First-time setup      |

---

# 🔄 Upgrades & Rollbacks

| Command                                         | Description                  | Usage                     |
| ----------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------- |
| `helm upgrade <release> <chart>`                | Upgrade a release            | Deploy new version        |
| `helm upgrade <release> <chart> -f values.yaml` | Upgrade with config          | 🔥 Most common            |
| `helm upgrade --install <release> <chart>`      | Install if not exists        | CI/CD pipelines           |
| `helm rollback <release> <revision>`            | Rollback to previous version | 🔥 Production recovery    |
| `helm history <release>`                        | Show release history         | Identify rollback version |

---

# 🔍 Debugging & Validation

| Command                                            | Description         | Usage               |
| -------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------- |
| `helm status <release>`                            | Show release status | Verify deployment   |
| `helm get values <release>`                        | Show applied values | Debug config issues |
| `helm get manifest <release>`                      | Show rendered YAML  | Inspect resources   |
| `helm lint <chart>`                                | Validate chart      | Catch errors early  |
| `helm template <chart>`                            | Render YAML locally | Debug before deploy |
| `helm template <chart> -f values.yaml`             | Render with values  | Validate configs    |
| `helm upgrade --dry-run --debug <release> <chart>` | Simulate deployment | 🔥 Safe testing     |

